   "id": "IMPL-M0-30",
   "text": "ARCH-46 says a cell stores its own equilibrium when the link ends in a wall-like cell; 03 section 2.5 item 2 says when the destination is not updat... Fix: ARCH-46 now uses the wording of 03 section 2.5 item 2"
  },
  {
   "id": "IMPL-M0-29",
   "text": "MEM-5 and condition 4 of 03 section 3.2 forbid a pass to write a slot outside its cell's set, but item 3 of the initialisation of section 2.5 (`imp... Fix: the initialisation write of section 2.5 item 3 is named as allowed in MEM-5 and in condition 4"
  },
  {
   "id": "IMPL-M0-28",
   "text": "ARCH-33 gives s = 82 for a bound of 10^-6; the stated formula 62 - ceil(log2(bound)) gives 81 Fix: example corrected to 81 (checked numerically)"
  },
  {
   "id": "IMPL-M0-26",
   "text": "no format for the schedule record; no place in the program for the tag, init and view kernels; VAL-7 names no generator or seeds and fixes TRT, whi... Fix: provisional record in brief M0-9 (confirmed by the M1-2 design note); kernels appended by a tail hook after the fused kernels; fixed seeds, SRT at..."
  },
  {
   "id": "IMPL-M0-25",
   "text": "`range` was checked for manifest defaults only; a configured value outside it reached the kernel Fix: configured values are checked against `range` and `range_open`"
  },
  {
   "id": "IMPL-M0-24",
   "text": "the order of the density and momentum sums was not stated, although bit comparisons with a host evaluation depend on it Fix: order stated"
  },
  {
   "id": "IMPL-M0-23",
   "text": "CORE-10 puts the uniform force first; the group order of ARCH-12 would run it last if another force fragment carried a set Fix: force fragments carry no set, order by `after`"
  },
